<li>Cameron, Averil. The Later Roman Empire. Harvard University Press, 1993.</<li>
<li>Norwich, John Julius. Byzantium: The Early Centuries. Viking, 1988.</<li>
<li>Ostrogorsky, George. History of the Byzantine State. Rutgers University Press, 1957.</<li>
</ol>

